{"name":"Field Notes No. 002","from":"Jonny Stanback <hello@jonnystanback.com>","reply_to":"hello@jonnystanback.com","subject":"Field Notes No. 002","html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Field Notes No. 002</title>\n<style>\n  @media (max-width:620px){ .wrap{width:100%!important} .pad{padding-left:22px!important;padding-right:22px!important} .stack{display:block!important;width:100%!important;padding:0 0 18px!important} }\n  a{color:#E41010}\n</style></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F4EBDA;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">A 5am sunrise shoot, what releasing music has given me, and a first listen to my new song, “A Million Stars.”</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#F4EBDA;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0 40px;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"wrap\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:600px;\">\n    <tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-family:'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5E5244;text-align:center;\">\n      Field Notes No. 002 &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"https://jonnystanback.com/inthefield/002\" style=\"color:#E41010;text-decoration:underline;\">Read on the web</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td><a href=\"https://jonnystanback.com/inthefield/002\"><img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/cover.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Jonny lying on a patterned couch in a wood-paneled room, under the red Field Notes masthead.\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\"></a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:22px 40px 8px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#13100C;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n        <td style=\"font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:14px;color:#13100C;\">11-25-26</td>\n        <td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#13100C;\">Santa Barbara, CA</td></tr></table></td></tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:18px 40px 10px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">I woke up at 5am last week to go shoot content in the sunrise. It was dark when I picked up my friend Dave, who was going to be the talented man behind the lens.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">We decided to shoot on a cliffside overlooking Santa Barbara.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">The scene was absolutely breathtaking. Cotton candy skies, small blue dotted clouds on the horizon, the ocean spray glowing warm peach tones as it was backlit by the sun.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">I had never been to this spot before at sunrise. And lo and behold, it was shooting content that got me there finally.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">I find it funny that I’ve lived here for two years, and it took needing to make an Instagram video to get me out there at five in the morning.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">Such is the state of the music industry!</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 26px;\"><tr>\n      <td class=\"stack\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right:8px;\"><img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/cliff.jpg\" width=\"270\" alt=\"A green cliffside dropping to the beach in Santa Barbara, the ocean on the left and a pale yellow sky with scattered clouds.\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\"><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-family:'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#13100C;text-align:center;\">A shot of the same Santa Barbara cliffside at sunset</p></td>\n      <td class=\"stack\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-left:8px;\"><img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/dave.jpg\" width=\"270\" alt=\"Dave, with curly hair, glasses and a mustache, holding his camera and gesturing in a dark parking lot.\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\"><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-family:'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#13100C;text-align:center;\">Dave with his camera</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">It made me think of how many amazing experiences I’ve had as side-effects of releasing music.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">Making lifelong friends, touring around the country in a van, playing shows to thousands of people, building something I’m proud of over the course of years...</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">I’m even remembering now that Sophie and I reconnected when I posted on Instagram about releasing music again.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">Truly so many blessings have come from putting my work out there, even when the vast majority of it didn’t have the “success” I was hoping for in my mind.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">As they say in the music industry:</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 22px;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/noteTrueLove.png\" width=\"300\" alt=\"Handwritten in red: “True love is better than a billion streams.”\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:300px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">(Just kidding, they definitely don’t say that).</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">It makes me think about why I make music in the first place.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">When I started, I was mesmerized by all the shiny rewards you could get if you “made it” and “became famous”.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">Now, I’m 31 (almost 32), which in the music industry is like 97. I have different motivations now.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">In a lot of ways though, I’m more motivated to release than ever. I think I’ve started to notice that making music and releasing it makes me a better person (hopefully others think so too).</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">Writing is hard. Releasing music is hard. Making content is hard.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">But every time I do finish a song, I think it changes me slightly. It requires me to be a little more honest. Dig a little deeper. Search a little bit harder for the truth.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">Now I think that’s way more exciting.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 22px;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/horse.png\" width=\"110\" alt=\"A small red drawing of a galloping horse.\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:110px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">When I first started releasing music, it was a little bit of an act. I was writing edgy blues rock, which I love, but the lyrics, and the energy behind it wasn’t truly who I was.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 26px;\"><tr><td>\n      <img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/show.jpg\" width=\"520\" alt=\"Jonny singing and playing a sunburst electric guitar on a club stage under teal lights, hands raised in the crowd in front of him.\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\"><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-family:'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#13100C;text-align:center;\">Playing a show around 2019. I think it’s part of the process of discovering who you are to have versions of yourself that aren’t the final product. We had a lot of fun back then, very grateful for the whole experience.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">It wasn’t completely off the mark, but I’ve had to accept that who I really am isn’t that guy.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">The real me is a little cornier, likes to joke around a lot, wants to live a low-key life with his family, and enjoys being outdoors.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">It’s been said a million times in the music industry: “Be authentic.”</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">For me it was a lot harder than that sounds.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">How can you be authentic if you don’t really know who you are? Or what you’re made of? At least that was my problem.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">I found out who I was by creating. By doing. By releasing.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">If I was being myself in the process, it became enjoyable and sustainable.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">Being myself also led me to people who share my vision. Making music with a team is way more rewarding than doing it alone, and I never could have gotten here by myself. Shoutout to Dave, Josh, Tom, Brett, Brielle and so many more!</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">The funny thing is, now that I’m less interested in becoming the artist I thought I needed to be, more people are listening than ever.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">Together, we passed 800,000 monthly listeners on Spotify this month. That would’ve blown my mind when I was in the band. A lot of you are part of that number too, so thank you for listening!</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">I don’t know how much of that has to do with any of this. But I do know I’m enjoying making music more than I ever have.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">I can’t help but think it’s because the music seems more true now than it ever has been.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">In the spirit of that, next week I’m releasing a new song that feels more like me than ever.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">It’s a little on the nose, a little earnest, but hey, I think maybe that’s who I am.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 22px;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/stars.png\" width=\"110\" alt=\"Three small red stars.\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:110px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">It’s called “A Million Stars.”</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 22px;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/listenHere.png\" width=\"110\" alt=\"Handwritten in red: Listen here, with an arrow pointing down to the player.\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:110px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">You get to hear it first. Here’s a sneak peek:</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0 22px;\"><tr><td>\n      <a href=\"https://jonnystanback.com/inthefield/002#a-million-stars\" style=\"display:block;background:#8A1E1E;border-radius:6px;padding:18px 20px;text-decoration:none;\">\n        <span style=\"font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:22px;color:#B4A884;\">&#9654;</span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B4A884;padding-left:10px;\">A Million Stars</span>\n        <span style=\"display:block;font-family:'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F05454;padding-top:8px;\">Tap to listen &rarr;</span>\n      </a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#13100C;\">I’m also adding this question section here. Feel free to ask me anything, I’d love to hear from you.</p><p style=\"margin:30px 0 6px;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:17px;color:#13100C;text-align:center;\">See you next month,</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://jonnystanback.com/field-notes/002/email/signature.png\" width=\"190\" alt=\"Jonny\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:190px;height:auto;border:0;\"></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:30px 0 10px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://jonnystanback.com/inthefield/002#ask\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#E41010;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'American Typewriter', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 28px;\">Ask a question &rarr;</a>\n      </td></tr></table></td></tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:26px 40px 0;border-top:1px solid #D9CCB4;font-family:'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#5E5244;text-align:center;\">\n      Hit reply anytime. It comes straight to me.<br>\n      <a href=\"https://jonnystanback.com/inthefield/002\" style=\"color:#E41010;\">Read this letter on the web</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"https://jonnystanback.com\" style=\"color:#E41010;\">jonnystanback.com</a><br><br>\n      You’re getting this because you signed up for Field Notes.<br>\n      Don’t want these? <a href=\"{{{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}}\" style=\"color:#5E5244;\">Unsubscribe</a>.\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</body></html>"}